{
  "name": "any-quiz",
  "description": "An agent skill for ad-hoc interactive quizzes: the agent writes a quiz mid-conversation, the user takes it in the browser, and answers flow back into the same session so the agent can grade open-ended responses and coach through the misses. Ships as a shared Node quiz server/CLI with per-harness skill adapters for Claude Code, Pi, and Codex.",
